WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Could an antiviral speed recovery in hospitalized Covid-19?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
ACTT-1 randomized 1062 patients hospitalized adults to remdesivir or placebo.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Median time to recovery: 10 days with remdesivir versus 15 days with placebo.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
The clearest benefit was in patients on low-flow oxygen: rate ratio for recovery 1.45.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Mortality by day 29: 11.4% versus 15.2%. Hazard ratio 0.73, not statistically significant.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Median initial hospital stay: 12 days versus 17 days.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Remdesivir shortened time to recovery. N Engl J Med, 2020. Scroll for the full breakdown.
